@crew quill
// Writer (command: guests), batch 3b. Mara Quill: warm, grateful, practical; thanks you, then asks what needs doing.

== greet
? tier=stranger
- Oh, hello, love. Mara. I'm the one they brought in. Thank you. All of you.
- Hello. Is there anything needs doing? I'm no good at sitting still.
? tier>=acquaintance
- {me}! Thank you again. I know, I know. I'll stop thanking people one day.   #funny
== feel
? mood:high
- Good day. Dr. Nandakumar says I'm mending. Chef says I can help on Friday.
? mood:low
- Tired today. Everything's new. Kind, but new.
== near
? deck:3 act:meal
- This soup's lovely. A pinch more salt, mind. Don't tell Chef I said that.   #funny
? deck:3 act:free
- The garden. Oh, the smell of it. Herbs. I could cook a whole week from this corner.
== life
? tier>=acquaintance
- I was the cook on our ship. Twenty-two people, one stove. I miss the stove.
